nce et Lycée Lumière à moins de 10 min à pied permettant de rejoindre facilement le centre-ville de Lyon. Et enfin, regagnez rapidement le périphérique Laurent Bonnevay et les grandes gares lyonnaises.\nUne opportunité idéale entre dynamisme urbain et douceur de vivre.\n*Voir Conditions sur LNC.fr.","addr":"\n\n44 Rue Pierre Delore\n","gal":["https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjU5MTlhZTVlYTBlZmUxYjMxNGVkNzc3MWY0NzFiYThhODE5N2ZlYWMiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI4NTA1OGZmYTM1MmM2ZDAxZWJlZjc4NGQzZGEzOTBiNyJ9?signature=be5c991f7693672e783eaf6456c4e064ecd4b21bfbfd9d89b4be86c7011b709c","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjE0YjcxMjAyOWIyN2MyYTVmODAyMTMzZWU2NjZmNTJiZmM0NWYxMWIiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiJiMzlhNjMxMjU2ZjI5ZmU0YWVjNjdiNjZhM2I4MzMxYiJ9?signature=572eb152645475e51edf21e61050d2dcedd9af19ee753cd2065c66fc2f2e0bea","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImYyNjkzMDY4ZGE5ZmE1ZGY4ZWYzNmI4MTA2ZmJiMGZlMGMzMzZiY2MiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiIzYzgyNDA5ZTZmMDZjMjJiNjhiMWVlMzE4NTk0YzNkNyJ9?signature=bd0448dab35289370e9fe7bd2508309eb759913668e82e86ea1eb0fce4bc696b","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6ImZlMzg2NDc2OWJlMmNmNmRiYWFmNmZiOGY1YTcyNmIxNTkyMWY5ZDQiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpemUiOnsid2lkdGgiOjkwMCwiaGVpZ2h0Ijo5MDAsImZpdCI6Imluc2lkZSJ9fSwiZmlsZUhhc2giOiI3MGU5YjEwNDFkZDkyNzk3NzVkYjRjOGY0MjNjNTc1NCJ9?signature=2572c02f891cac878a1ddb6c92774f9e011b1aca7473ff2b8fe6c18fde1a5889","https://dj32ymiemc11o.cloudfront.net/eyJidWNrZXQiOiJvdGFyZWUtcHJvZHVjdGlvbi1maWxlcyIsImtleSI6IjEyMTcwZTEwMDhiNmNlMzNhZmU1OTJlN2ZiNGY5NmRiYjk5YjgwMWIiLCJlZGl0cyI6eyJyZXNpem